    "title": "tee - Write standard input to a file and pass it on",
    "synopsis": "tee <file>",
    "description": "Saves whatever flows through it and then hands the same text to the next stage, which is what makes a pipeline durable.",
    "details": "NAME\n  tee - Write standard input to a file and pass it on\n\nSYNOPSIS\n  tee <file>\n\nDESCRIPTION\n  Saves whatever flows through it and then hands the same text to the next stage, which is what makes a pipeline durable.\n\nOPTIONS\n  <file>\n    Where to write.\n\nDEVICE COST\n  Exactly one POST /api/fs/write.\n\nSEE ALSO\n  cat(1), clip(1), base64(1)\n\nEXAMPLES\n  diag | tee /data/diag.txt\n  dmesg -l E | tee /data/errors.txt | wc"
